{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Half the blood.</b> Of the burnt offerings and the peace offerings." "And the word באגנות [basins] means round vessels, like אגן הסהר (Song 7:3), and in Arabic, agan." "And half the blood of the burnt offering and the peace offering he cast upon the altar to the name of YHWH. And so באגנות serves for both: he put half in basins and the other half afterward in basins."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:55.814273062Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}